        "procedure": "A mixture of La2O3 (0.0489 g, 0.15 mmol), 9-Haca (0.0222 g, 0.10 mmol), tptz (0.0156 g, 0.10 mmol), H2O (3 mL), ethanol (2 mL) and 37% acetic acid (0.8 mL) was stirred for 0.5 h, sealed in a 25 mL Teflon-lined autoclave, and heated at 120 °C for 7 d. After slow cooling to room temperature, yellow sheet crystals of 1 were obtained.",
